  "notes": "Basisschool has groep 1–8; groep 1–2 are kleuters (pre-primary, from age 4) and are excluded, so year 1 is groep 3. Secondary depends on track: vmbo 4 years, havo 5, vwo 6. The file follows vwo, the longest track; havo and vmbo learners use the same klas numbers for their shorter courses."
